return {
    ["\n　　艾莉卡发现了。她质问我和贝丝的关系……争吵……我发誓我不是故意的……但磨坊烧起来了……她还在里面，她……\n　　……即使我出身贵族，发生这么大的事治安官也会找上门来。我必须去找贝丝。她在骨桥等我。她说会带我躲进山里……\n　　等等……贝丝身边的那个人是谁……那张脸……那不是艾莉卡吗？！她不是已经……\n　　她们在笑……向我走来……她们的脸在变化……变得和我……一样……"] = "\n	Erica found out. She questioned my relationship with Beth... an argument... I swear I didn't mean it... but the mill caught fire... she was still inside, she...\n	...Even if I come from a noble family, the sheriff will come knocking after such a big incident. I must go find Beth. She is waiting for me at Bone Bridge. She said she would take me to hide in the mountains...\n	Wait... who is that person beside Beth... that face... isn't that Erica?! Didn't she already...\n	They are laughing... walking towards me... their faces are changing... becoming... just like... mine...",
