    ["<Assistant_Title1>【人脉好感-快速互动】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>快速互动说明：</>各位非凡者可以通过同时消耗<Assistant_Red>【漫忆请柬】</>道具与<Assistant_Red>书信往来次数</>，直接增加与选中的人脉角色对应的好感度。\n<Assistant_Title2>快速互动入口说明：</>各位非凡者可以在对应的人脉好感度界面，点击<Assistant_Red>邀约函集</>按钮，开启对应人脉的快速互动功能。\n<Assistant_Title2>快速互动次数说明：</>快速互动分为角色专属互动次数与月卡权益互动次数，两者独立分开计算。进行快速互动时，优先消耗角色专属快速互动次数，再消耗月卡权益互动次数。\n<Assistant_Title2>角色专属快速互动次数：</>非凡者与对应人脉好感度等级达到2级后，每日可获得<Assistant_Red>2次</>与该人脉的专属快速互动次数。每日获得的快速互动次数会随着人脉好感度等级提升而提升，每级提升2次互动次数，最高每日可获得<Assistant_Red>10次</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>快速互动月卡权益说明：</>各位非凡者每日还可获得5次全人脉共享的快速互动次数，最高可累计15次，但是全人脉共享快速互动次数只有在月卡有效期可以使用。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>[Connection Favorability-Quick Interaction]</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quick Interaction Explanation: </>Beyonders can directly increase favorability with selected connection characters by consuming <Assistant_Red>[Memory Invitation]</> items and <Assistant_Red>letter exchange attempts</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quick Interaction Entry Explanation: </>Beyonders can click the <Assistant_Red>Invitation Collection</> button on the corresponding connection favorability interface to open the quick interaction function for that connection.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quick Interaction Attempts Explanation: </>Quick interactions are divided into character-exclusive interaction attempts and monthly card benefit interaction attempts, which are calculated separately. When performing a quick interaction, character-exclusive attempts are consumed first, followed by monthly card benefit attempts.\n<Assistant_Title2>Character-Exclusive Quick Interaction Attempts: </>After a Beyonder reaches favorability level 2 with a corresponding connection, they can obtain <Assistant_Red>2</> exclusive quick interaction attempts with that connection daily. The number of quick interaction attempts obtained daily will increase as the connection favorability level increases, with 2 attempts added per level, up to a maximum of <Assistant_Red>10</> attempts daily.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quick Interaction Monthly Card Benefit Explanation: </>Beyonders can also obtain 5 quick interaction attempts shared across all connections daily, which can be accumulated up to 15 times, but these shared attempts can only be used while the monthly card is valid.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【魔女的滋味】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>城市暗面玩法奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得魔女的滋味套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>城市暗面悬赏值解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Taste of the Witch】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Outfit rewarded for City of Shadows gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Taste of the Witch set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlock via City of Shadows Bounty Value.",
