    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n“歌剧魅影”第三场搭配现已开放，剧院静候您的前来。\n周五20:00，演出将准时开启。请您务必留意，在周五19:30前加入一家具有参赛资格的俱乐部，并成为<M_Orange>正式成员</>，完成外观搭配。参与搭配，即可收获馈赠。俱乐部搭配评分<M_Orange>前五名</>将获得登台资格。\n愿您在舞台上如星辰般闪耀，稍后再见！"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\nThe third \"Phantom of the Opera\" outfit coordination is now open. The theater awaits your arrival. \nThe performance will start promptly on Friday at 20:00. Please be sure to join a club with participation eligibility before 19:30 on Friday, become an <M_Orange>official member</>, and complete your outfit coordination. Participate in the coordination to receive gifts. The top <M_Orange>five</> clubs in coordination scores will earn the qualification to perform on stage. \nMay you shine like a star on stage, see you later!",
